.TH ASSERT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
ASSERT \- Stop the program (with a message naming the file and line) if condition c is false, in Debug builds; compiled out in Release builds, so c must have no side effects
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqdebug.h\(dq
.ft B
#define ASSERT(c) SDL_assert(c)
.ft R
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Stop the program (with a message naming the file and line) if condition c is false, in Debug builds; compiled out in Release builds, so c must have no side effects. Guard invariants: ASSERT(g\->count <= MAX_ENTITIES), ASSERT(index >= 0).
.SH MODULE
debug (src/engine/debug/debug.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR LOG (3),
.BR WARN (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
